      hu: ["Legmagasabb pontja a Szajram-csúcs (4238 m).", "Az Ugam-Csatkal Nemzeti Park része.", "A vonulat hossza körülbelül 115 kilométer.", "Itt él az őshonos Sievers-vadalmafa.", "A hegység választja el az Ugam és a Pszkem folyókat.", "Gazdag mészkőformációkban és karsztbarlangokban."],
      ro: ["Vârful Sairam este cea mai înaltă cotă (4238 m).", "Face parte din Parcul Național Ugam-Chatkal.", "Lanțul are o lungime de aproximativ 115 km.", "Adăpostește populații de leoparzi de zăpadă.", "Munții alimentează direct râul Chirchiq.", "Include numeroase formațiuni carstice și cascade."],
      en: ["The highest point is Sairam Peak at 4,238 meters.", "Part of the protected Ugam-Chatkal National Park area.", "The range extends for approximately 115 kilometers.", "Host to the wild Sievers' apple, ancestor of domestic apples.", "Major contributor to the water volume of Charvak Reservoir.", "Features significant karst systems and deep canyons."],
