      en: ["Adelung Peak (4,301m) is one of Uzbekistan's highest points.", "The range extends for a distance of 160 kilometers.", "Home to several small glaciers and permanent snowfields.", "Crucial for the water balance of the Tashkent region.", "The average ridge elevation exceeds 3,200 meters.", "The Pskem river basin is a major hydropower resource."],
