      en: ["The Maidantal Range extends for a length of about 50 kilometers.", "The highest peaks in the range rise above 4,000 meters.", "The mountains form part of the border between Uzbekistan and Kazakhstan.", "The range separates the drainage basins of the Maidantal and Oygaing rivers.", "Granites and Paleozoic sedimentary rocks dominate the geology.", "Numerous small cirque glaciers are located in the high-altitude areas."],
